  "subject": "whether transport.rewind and transport.fast_forward move the playhead one bar and stop, through the route a server with no route restriction takes, in ten languages",
  "question": "From a stopped transport at bar 9, does each call leave the playhead one bar away in its own direction at 0.5, 1.5 and 3.0 s after the reply, and which channel answered it, in each of Logic's ten languages; and what did the merge-base binary do from the same start?",
