    "command": "python3 Scripts/livekit/live_1092_rewind_and_forward_step_one_bar.py <worktree> <full-40-char-head> <debug binary>",
    "expected": "every row reads bar 9 before the call, the bar one away at all three samples, and CGEvent as the only channel that ran; with --lprojs ko en and the merge-base binary, no row passes",
    "cost": "run as /usr/bin/python3 with LPM_LIVE_LOCK naming a held lock, LPM_EVIDENCE_ROOT an absolute path outside the repository and LPM_LOCALE_FIXTURE the locale fixture; relaunches Logic once per language, about two minutes per language"
